OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fgradually easing this evening,
OL,7,Falthough a few may continue overnight,
OL,8,Fespecially towards the north and west.
OL,9,FClearer skies will bring a chilly
OL,10,Fnight, especially in rural areas with
OL,11,Fsome mist and fog patches.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA mostly dry, bright day
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells and patches of fair
OL,15,Fweather cloud. After a cool start,
OL,16,Ftemperatures will rise to around
OL,17,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
